      "source": "https://cloverchamberscreekwatershedcouncil.blog/2023/05/16/an-oral-history-of-clover-creek/",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Clover Creek’s main stream begins at Steilacoom Lake, flows under McChord Field, and empties into Chambers Bay near the golf course in University Place.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        28,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://pierceprairiepost.com/2025/04/26/where-is-clover-creek/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Most residents of Clover Creek are unaware of the creek’s path, with many answering “no” when asked if they know where it is.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
